description	"The Gunslinger

The Gunslinger is a variant of the Hero that replaces a heavy blaster pistol and longer ranged weaponry in favor of a pair of lighter pistols. The gunslinger's armament is supplemented with a unusually large and varied stock of thrown explosives.

^2Weaponry:
- Dual Blaster Pistols (3)
- 2 Frag Grenades
- 2 Fire Grenades
- 2 Sonic Detonators
- 2 Cryo Grenades

^8Attributes:
- Flipkick (1)
- Heal (3)
- CTF: 30s Respawn

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Dash (2) ^3[CS2]

^2Strengths^7: All Around strong class, with a healthy mix of weapons for a wide variety of ranges, with good protection and good mobility.
^1Weaknesses^7: As a generalist class, this class can be outperformed by specialist classes when said said specialist's strengths are played to."